egory_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"wYdlP6g2y6gK_RmLrPhsGA","review_id":"UKTzNtmdjJmGa1HrZNESCg","date":"2011-03-18T22:30:45","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9499233961105347,"text_excerpt":"Going back to Lola's for dinner tonight - i've eaten here several times over the past ten years and for some reason I always forget about it promptly as soon as I have wiped the garlic from my lips. Glad a friend suggested it! Looking forward to trying out the sangria (fingers crossed for white) and cramming as much of that amazing garlic spread into my yapper as I can fit! Will post after dining with my thoughts. Sweet mother of pearl - This time i PROMISE I will remember you, Lola of the Garlic flavored goodness! Yes, we had to wait 45 minutes for a table (although the white sangria certainly eased the pain) but as soon as we got our table the goodness was a flowin, and amply. There was..."},{"business_id":"wYdlP6g2y6gK_RmLrPhsGA","review_id":"XrBLnPLMIDeMUWpEDaxH4Q","date":"2012-01-03T00:57:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9464580416679382,"text_excerpt":"I really dig Lola's, and one of the nice things about it is there's something on the menu for everyone. So if you have a group of people with really varied tastes, everyone will be a happy camper. Lola's is a pretty small spot, and they don't take reservations. So you'll probably have to put your name on a list and then hang out for a while out in front of the restaurant. It took about 45 minutes on a weekday night for our group of 6 to be seated. I've never had the paella (I know! But it will happen one day!) so I can't speak to that, but the antipasti, garlic soup, and garlic shrimp are all quite good. And NOM NOM NOM, what is in that garlic spread stuff? Tastes like raw garlic, which i..."},{"business_id":"wYdlP6g2y6gK_RmLrPhsGA","review_id":"lstsT3fQAoxYsBCkSWH1ag","date":"2012-08-12T18:54:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9428435564041138,"text_excerpt":"I'm kind of smitten with Lola's. I have hazy, beautiful memories of my time spent in Spain. Lots of wine. Lots of paella, olives and tiny plates of marinated vegetables. Lots of friendly, lovely people. Lots of staying up until dawn or later. Lola's brought back all the memories into focus. The food. Wow. WOW. My fingers are paralyzed with ecstasy as I tried to recapture the experience. Easily one of the best meals I've had in New Orleans. Of course if you're a fan of Spanish food and flavors, you know what to expect, and maybe it's been a while since I've had it, but I was pretty blown away. You can see in the other reviews mentions of garlic. I'm a garlic lover, it's true and if you don..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"wYdlP6g2y6gK_RmLrPhsGA","photo_id":"F6sKaDboh1pF1dB1uFcbBg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/F6sKaDboh1pF1dB1uFcbBg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.89378821849823},{"business_id":"wYdlP6g2y6gK_RmLrPhsGA","photo_id":"VGccHXd8FC5utD3XoChUyg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/VGccHXd8FC5utD3XoChUyg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8194046020507812},{"business_id":"wYdlP6g2y6gK_RmLrPhsGA","photo_id":"tslDf5O5mm4pC0fXTXhqtA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/tslDf5O5mm4pC0fXTXhqtA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7924312353134155},{"business_id":"wYdlP6g2y6gK_RmLrPhsG